    "questionNumber": 162,
    "question": "A horizontal pipe of radius $4\\text{ cm}$ narrows down to a radius of $2\\text{ cm}$. If water flows through the wider section at $1\\text{ m/s}$, what is the flow speed in the narrow section?",
